#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Node gbanwere mgbe e sere ibe ahụ gasịrị, ya mere emeghị ihe ọ bụla. Nyochaa ya ma nwaa ọzọ."

