msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "E chekwara fabric ahụ."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Nnyocha nke fabric a na-aga n'ihu, ya mere ehichapụghị ihe ọ bụla. Nwaa ọzọ mgbe o rụchara."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Ehichapụrụ fabric ahụ na ndekọ ihe ya. Agbanweghị ngwaọrụ Cacti ọ bụla ma kpọtụrụghị fabric ahụ."

