msgstr "Atụrụla node ahụ na ngwaọrụ ugbu a."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Ọ bụghị main poller na-enyocha fabric nke node ahụ, ya mere enweghị ike ịnyocha ngwaọrụ ya."

