#: lib/HealthPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Fabric %s: it is assigned to poller %d, but only the main poller can sweep a fabric until remote poller support is added. It is not swept; assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Fabric %s: ekenyere ya poller %d, mana naanị main poller nwere ike ịnyocha fabric ruo mgbe agbakwụnyere nkwado remote poller. Anaghị enyocha ya; kenye ya main poller."

