msgstr "Ịdọ aka ná ntị amaghị"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Ngwaọrụ Nchọpụta Nsogbu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Ndekọ zuru oke, na poller ọ bụla na-enyocha fabric, nke nwere perfquery, ibnetdiscover, na iblinkinfo. Ngwugwu Debian na Ubuntu na-etinye ha na /usr/sbin. Enweghị mmemme ọzọ a na-agba site na ya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Ndekọ Ngwaọrụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Maapụ Aha Nọọdụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke nke nhọrọ gaa na faịlụ maapụ aha nọọdụ infiniband-diags. A na-egosi naanị aha ndị o nyere; njirimara bụ mgbe niile node GUID."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Njedebe Datagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Milisekọnd datagram njikwa ọ bụla nwere ike iwere tupu ngwaọrụ anwaa ya ọzọ (nhọrọ -t ha)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Njedebe Iwu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Sekọnd otu ọsọ ngwaọrụ nwere ike iwere tupu a kwụsị ya ma dekọọ ya dị ka ọ dara ada."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB otu ọsọ ngwaọrụ nwere ike ibipụta. A na-atụfu mmepụta buru ibu ma dekọọ ya dị ka ọ dara ada."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Mmepụta Kachasị"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Nnyocha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Oke Oge Nọọdụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Sekọnd otu nnyocha nọọdụ nwere ike iji gụọ kaụnta. A na-agụ ọdụ njikọ a na-eruteghị n'okirikiri na-abịa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Ọdụ njikọ dara ada nke ga-eme ka nnyocha nọọdụ kwụsị maka okirikiri a. Ọdụ njikọ na-azaghị na-ewe ọtụtụ sekọnd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Oke Ọdịda Nọọdụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Depụta Ọdụ Njikọ Adịghị Arụ Ọrụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, ajụjụ data Fabric Port na-edepụtakwa ọdụ njikọ ndị anọghị n'ọrụ ma enweghị njedebe dịpụrụ adịpụ, dị ka ọdụ njikọ adapter a na-ejighị. Mgbe ewepụrụ akara, a na-ahapụ ha ruo mgbe ha ga-amalite ịrụ ọrụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Debe Tebụl Mgbakwunye Mgbe A Na-ewepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, iwepụ plọgin ahụ na-edebe fabric ya, ngwaahịa dị na ndekọ, na nlele ya. Wepụ akara ka iwepụ ahụ tufuo ha; buru ụzọ bupụ ngwaahịa dị na ndekọ site na peeji Fabric Admin. A naghị akpọtụrụ fabric ahụ n'ụzọ ọ bụla."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Ndekọ ngwaọrụ ga-abụrịrị ụzọ zuru oke nke mkpụrụedemede, ọnụọgụ, ntụpọ, akara nkwụsị, ahịrị okpuru, na slash, na-enweghị slash n'ikpeazụ."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Ndekọ ngwaọrụ adịghị maọbụ abụghị ndekọ."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Ụzọ ndekọ ngwaọrụ nwere njikọ ihe atụ. Tinye ezigbo ụzọ."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Ọ bụghị root nwe ndekọ ngwaọrụ ahụ."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Otu ya maọbụ ndị ọzọ nwere ike ide ihe na ndekọ ngwaọrụ ahụ."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Ọ bụghị root nwe ngwaọrụ nchọpụta nsogbu ahụ."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Otu ya maọbụ ndị ọzọ nwere ike ide ihe na ngwaọrụ nchọpụta nsogbu ahụ."

